---
import { sitePath } from "../lib/paths";
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Contact from '../components/Contact.astro';
import Arrow from '../components/Arrow.astro';
import { person } from '../data/portfolio';
---
<Layout title="Profile — Álex Mena" active="profile">
  <section class="profile-hero container"><div><div class="section-kicker"><span class="small-square"></span>A little more about me</div><h1>A human perspective.<br /><em>A product mind.</em></h1><p class="profile-lead">I’m Alexandra Mena Sansano. I work where product direction, human behaviour and delivery have to meet.</p><p>I trained in audiovisual communication and photography before moving into digital product design. Narrative, context and visual sensitivity still shape how I work: I pay attention to how people interpret a system before asking them to use it.</p><p>I can own decisions as a senior individual contributor or direct a multidisciplinary team. In both cases, I stay close enough to protect the product’s logic and broad enough to connect the business and technical realities.</p><a class="button button-dark" href={sitePath(person.cv)} download>Download my CV <Arrow diagonal /></a></div><figure class="profile-portrait"><img src={sitePath("/images/alexandra-portrait.jpg")} width="1202" height="1800" alt="Alexandra Mena Sansano" /><figcaption>Álex / Madrid</figcaption></figure></section>
  <section class="profile-point container"><div class="section-kicker"><span class="small-square"></span>On AI</div><div><h2>The interesting question is<br /><em>what changes for the person.</em></h2><p>I have led LLM-based products and AI-assisted decision tools, and used AI to build interactive prototypes. I’m interested in the task, the evidence and the room left for human judgement. A convincing prototype still has to prove itself in context.</p><p>The role of AI differs between projects. In Coca-Cola and CaixaBank, it is part of the product proposition. In Zip Water, it helped the design and prototyping process. I keep that distinction visible.</p></div></section>
  <section class="experience-section container" id="experience"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="section-kicker"><span class="small-square"></span>The path so far</div><h2>Experience, <em>connected.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href={sitePath(person.cv)} download>Full CV <Arrow diagonal /></a></div><div class="experience-list">
    <div class="experience-row"><span>2026 — Present</span><div><h3>Mormedi</h3><p>Lead Digital Product Designer</p></div><p>Product and service work across banking, mobility, aviation and other sectors, with AI-supported research and prototyping.</p></div>
    <div class="experience-row"><span>2023 — 2026</span><div><h3>The Cocktail / VML</h3><p>Lead Product Designer</p></div><p>Global banking platforms, applied AI and brand-to-product transformation. Teams of up to 22 people.</p></div>
    <div class="experience-row"><span>2021 — 2023</span><div><h3>The Cocktail</h3><p>Product Designer & Behavioral Design Specialist</p></div><p>Research, product design and behavioural economics. Mentoring through Google Growth Academy.</p></div>
    <div class="experience-row"><span>2019 — 2023</span><div><h3>Constancia 3</h3><p>UX/UI Designer & Co-founder</p></div><p>A multidisciplinary creative practice spanning digital products, identity, editorial, video and photography.</p></div>
    <div class="experience-row"><span>2016 — 2019</span><div><h3>Art & cultural projects</h3><p>Humanae / Galería Elvira González</p></div><p>Project management, visual communication and exhibition work. A foundation in context, narrative and cultural production.</p></div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="profile-next container"><div class="section-kicker"><span class="small-square"></span>What I’m looking for</div><h2>Room to shape the product.<br /><em>People to build it with.</em></h2><p>Senior product design roles with real ownership, close collaboration with engineering and influence over direction. An established team where design contributes to the decisions as well as the experience.</p><p>Based in Madrid. Open to hybrid roles in Madrid and remote roles from Spain. Spanish native and professionally fluent in English.</p></section>
  <Contact />
</Layout>
